  '<section id="highlights" class="highlights" aria-label="Featured apps"><div id="highlightCards" class="highlight-cards"><a class="highlight-card" data-entity-id="solar-design-studio" href="https://globalgrid2050.com/energy-transition-simulator/202609282123/overlay.html"><span class="highlight-label">Design</span><strong>Solar Design Studio</strong><span class="highlight-description">Walk, fly and design on real terrain</span></a><a class="highlight-card" data-entity-id="gridatlas" href="https://ventusltd.github.io/gridatlas/atlas/"><span class="highlight-label">Explore</span><strong>GridAtlas</strong><span class="highlight-description">Explore the electricity network</span></a><a class="highlight-card" data-entity-id="electricity-market-intelligence" href="https://globalgrid2050.com/uk_energy_tracking_v6/"><span class="highlight-label">Markets</span><strong>Electricity Market Intelligence</strong><span class="highlight-description">GB electricity markets and generation</span></a><a class="highlight-card" data-entity-id="cable-engineering" href="https://globalgrid2050.com/ac_cables_knowledge/"><span class="highlight-label">Learn</span><strong>Cable Engineering</strong><span class="highlight-description">AC and DC cable guides and tools</span></a></div></section>\n' +
  '<main>\n' +
  '<h2 class="sections-heading">Browse sections</h2>\n' +
  '<section id="nests" aria-label="Tools and versions">\n' +
  '<details id="solar-design-studio"><summary><span class="number">01</span><span class="title">Solar Design Studio<small>Walk, fly and design on real terrain</small></span></summary><div class="inside"><p>Walk and fly over real ground from Environment Agency LiDAR, then design on it. The GIS, SLD &amp; Financial Sandbox remains available among the earlier releases.</p><a class="launch" href="https://globalgrid2050.com/energy-transition-simulator/202609282123/overlay.html">Open Solar Design Studio &rarr;</a><details id="electrical-scene-explorer"><summary><span class="number">&#8611;</span><span class="title">Electrical Scene Explorer<small>Solar Design Studio drawing prototype</small></span></summary><div class="inside"><p>Explore an illustrative electrical scene in 3D, inspect array geometry and follow modelled cable routes. Prototype, not a surveyed site or approved engineering design.</p><a class="launch" href="https://globalgrid2050.com/solar-design-studio/202609262041-site-world/">Open drawing prototype &rarr;</a></div></details><details id="energy-transition-simulator"><summary><span class="number">&#8611;</span><span class="title">Energy Transition Simulator<small>Solar farming with power grids, on real UK ground (preview)</small></span></summary><div class="inside"><p>Walk and fly anywhere in the UK over measured Environment Agency LiDAR, streamed where you arrive. Tables, trenches, lines and stations are modelled on the satellite and labelled as measured, documented or estimated. A preview, not a surveyed site or an approved engineering design.</p><a class="launch" href="https://globalgrid2050.com/energy-transition-simulator/202609282123/overlay.html">Open the simulator preview &rarr;</a></div></details></div></details>\n' +
  '<details id="kuiper"><summary><span class="number">02</span><span class="title">Kuiper<small>The animated universe of code</small></span></summary><div class="inside"><p>Explore patterns across code, text and mathematics, with intended adaptations for drawing and proposal work.</p><a class="launch" href="https://globalgrid2050.com/kuiper/">Enter Kuiper &rarr;</a><details id="what-is-kuiper"><summary><span class="number">&#8611;</span><span class="title">What is the Kuiper?<small>Why the code estate became a mathematical address space</small></span></summary><div class="inside"><p>A plain-English explanation of why Kuiper exists, what a Key means, how the placement law works, and how the visualisation is becoming a procedural computational engine.</p><a class="launch" href="https://ventusltd.github.io/kuiper-belt/what-is-kuiper.html">Read What is the Kuiper? &rarr;</a></div></details></div></details>\n' +
